# Credits

## DOOM

- **id Software** created DOOM; its source code was later released under the GPL license. The fire algorithm originates from the DOOM engine.
- The PlayStation (PSX) version of DOOM popularized this specific fire effect, which serves as the direct inspiration for this project.

## Fire Algorithm

- **Fabien Sanglard**: His article documents and explains the DOOM/PSX fire algorithm and serves as the primary reference for this implementation. 
https://fabiensanglard.net/doom_fire_psx/index.html
- **Filipe Deschamps** and the entire `doom-fire-algorithm` community—a playground featuring implementations of the effect in JavaScript, Kotlin, Rust, Python, Flutter, Godot, Swift, C++, and many other languages, including variants with HSL color control. 
https://github.com/filipedeschamps/doom-fire-algorithm

## Sister Implementations

